item.description:
DJ Mood Find the perfect playlist for every mood DJ Mood unlocks over 250 hidden Apple Music playlists that you can only discover by asking Siri — until now. All beautifully organized by mood, activity, and vibe.
Curated by Apple, surfaced by DJ Mood Access 250+ &ldquo;Siri playlists&rdquo; that Apple created but never made browsable — from &ldquo;Feeling Happy&rdquo; to &ldquo;Rainy Day Vibes&rdquo; to &ldquo;Workout Intensity.&rdquo;
Effortless discovery No more guessing what to ask Siri or hunting through search.
